# Build output
ZoniStation_One
cpu_test
*.o
*.d

# Debug / capture output
emulator_log.txt
*.ppm
logs/
*.txt
# ...but licence notices must ship: MIT requires them to be present.
!**/LICENSE.txt

# ROM files / BIOS images (copyrighted — do not distribute)
roms/
*.BIN
*.bin

# Game disc images (do not distribute)
games/*.bin
games/*.iso
games/*.cue
games/*.img
games/*.exe
games/*.99
games/*.mdf
games/*.mds
# Compressed disc images and their LibCrypt subchannel patches. Neither was
# covered before: *.bin does not match *.bin.ecm, and .sbi had no rule at all,
# so `git status` listed games/ as untracked and a stray `git add games/` would
# have committed a disc image.
games/*.ecm
games/*.sbi

# Reference / large external codebases
duckstation_ref/
duckstation/

# Backup files
backup/
*.bak

# Screenshots (except the ones actually referenced by README.md).
# 'screenshots/*' not 'screenshots/': a re-include below cannot reach inside a
# directory that is itself excluded.
screenshots/*
Screenshot*.png
!screenshots/Screenshot 2026-02-22 153306.png
!screenshots/Screenshot 2026-05-02 212421.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-14 191115.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-18 115008.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-18 115014.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-18 125717.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-18 125937.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-23 214744.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-26 230210.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-27 215006.png
!Screenshot 2026-07-30 192724.png
!screenshots/2026-08-06-*.png
!screenshots/2026-08-21-*.png

# Misc
Hack.zip

# Lionel Flandrin's PlayStation emulation guide. Consulted, never redistributed:
# simias/psx-guide ships no LICENSE, so every right is reserved to its author.
guide.tex

# The nocash PSX specification (the psx-spx fork). Cited by file and line all
# over this codebase, and kept locally for that reason — but not redistributed:
# psx-spx.github.io's own README states that "no copyright or license have been
# properly acquired to republish and alter this document". Clone it yourself:
#   git clone https://github.com/psx-spx/psx-spx.github.io
#   ln -s psx-spx.github.io/docs DOCS
DOCS/

# Per-machine runtime state, not source. These were tracked for a long time, so
# a .gitignore entry alone did nothing — they had to be removed from the index.
imgui.ini
*.mcd

# Audio captures from ZS1_AUDIO_DUMP (diagnostic output)
*.wav
*.raw

# Savestates — machine-specific binary snapshots, several MB each
savestates/

# Screenshots captured under a non-English locale ("Schermata del ...").
# The rule above only covers the English "Screenshot*.png" name.
Schermata*.png

# Stray third-party image, removed 2026-08-01
maxresdefault.jpg

# Official psx-spx clone, same redistribution constraint as DOCS/
psx-spx-docs/

# Language-server database, generated by `make compile_commands` from the
# Makefile lists. Machine-specific paths, so it stays out of the index.
compile_commands.json

# Generated from src/gpu/shaders/*.{vert,frag} by the build; never edit or commit.
src/gpu/shaders/*.spv
src/gpu/shaders/*.spv.h

# Per-session memory cards, savestates and frame dumps written by cluster runs.
cluster-data/

# Unit test binaries and profile-guided optimisation data
tests/bin/
pgo/
tests/hw/build/

# Python bytecode (deploy/session/webrtc_server.py, tests/hw/elf2exe.py)
__pycache__/
